# co_window_cross_2 is a common window piece.
# Intersecting corridors pass through glass-wall arms. This changes how the floor connects.
# Its tag and WEIGHT let the controller select it without a file list.
NAME: co_window_cross_2
WEIGHT: 1
TAGS: transparent allow_dup extra serial_co_window_common
MAP
xxxxxx@@xxxxxx
xxxxxx..xxxxxx
xxxxxx..xxxxxx
xxxxxx..xxxxxx
xxxxxx..xxxxxx
@....m..m....@
@....m..m....@
xxxxxx..xxxxxx
xxxxxx..xxxxxx
xxxxxx..xxxxxx
xxxxxx..xxxxxx
xxxxxx@@xxxxxx
ENDMAP
